BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_314507057@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260507T035412Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260516T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260516T160000
SUMMARY:Asheville Wine Trail
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n📣 Cross-posted from Asheville Transpl
 ants group\n\nNew to Asheville and haven't explored the local wine scene y
 et? Same. Let's fix that.\n\nWe're doing a casual self-guided wine trail t
 hrough some of the best wineries in the Asheville area — think gorgeous 
 mountain views\, great pours\, and even better conversation. The wineries 
 are a short scenic drive from town (about 20-30 minutes)\, so we'll carpoo
 l from our starting point and hit 2-3 spots over the afternoon.\n\nThis is
  low-key\, no pressure — just a group of transplants who'd rather share 
 a glass of wine with new friends than scroll Netflix alone on a Saturday. 
 Whether you're a wine snob or a "I'll have whatever's good" person\, you b
 elong here.\n\nWhat to Know:\n\n• Tasting fees are on your own (typicall
 y $10-20/winery — varies by location)\n\n• We'll coordinate carpools d
 ay-of — driving is required since the wineries are outside the city\n\n
 • Bring your sense of adventure and an empty stomach — we'll grab a la
 te lunch at the last stop\n\nSpace is limited to 20 so we can actually get
  to know each other. Grab your spot!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314507057
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260427T135716Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260427T135716Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
